# Development-only resource layer.
#
# Included by `./scripts/build-edge.sh --dev`, never by a normal build. It adds
# resources-dev, whose properties.xml carries a local server URL and the
# well-known development token, so the simulator connects the moment it starts.
#
# The token in there is the one from docker/compose.dev.yaml. It is not a
# secret and is useless against any real deployment — but the layer is still
# kept out of default builds so it cannot reach a device by accident.

base.resourcePath = $(base.resourcePath);resources-dev
